<p>The resulting graphic is below! The <code>add_source_caption()</code> and <code>add_author_caption()</code> functions are custom functions I created for my own <a href="https://github.com/joshpersi/utilities">personal utilities</a> package that contains the <code>grid::grid.draw()</code> bit and is available on Github.</p>
